{"3578110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Biathlon Challenge", "steam_appid": 3578110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biathlon Challenge</strong> is a fast-paced FPS/platformer where style, speed and precision collide. Test your reflexes, creativity, and style through deadly courses, chain trick shots, and stunts to build combos—all while racing the clock for the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Loadout:</strong>  <br>Mix and match your guns and gear to suit your playstyle or challenge yourself with absurd combinations. Each piece affects the way you move, aim, and score. Earn new gear from perfect runs, high scores, or by uncovering hidden stashes. Skis? Snowboard? Shotgun? Parachute? <i>Cigar</i>? It’s all fair game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/f3106602201ecce4a54d9f85b0a4c7df.poster.avif?t=1787103712\" width=776 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/f3106602201ecce4a54d9f85b0a4c7df.webm?t=1787103712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578110/extras/f3106602201ecce4a54d9f85b0a4c7df.mp4?t=1787103712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunts + Shooting = Combo Heaven:</strong> <br>Pull off stunts while landing precise shots to build up your score multiplier. The more stylish your run, the higher your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i